{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"11":"The Rites of Hajj (Kitab Al-Manasik Wa'l-Hajj)"},"section_detail":{"11":{"hadithnumber_first":1721,"hadithnumber_last":2045,"arabicnumber_first":1721,"arabicnumber_last":2045,"name_native":"كتاب المناسك والحج"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1728,"arabicnumber":1728,"text":"حدثنا نصر بن علي، حدثنا ابو احمد، حدثنا سفيان، عن عبيد الله، عن نافع، ان ابن عمر، كان يردف مولاة له يقال لها صفية تسافر معه الى مكة","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":11,"hadith":8}}]}